# ArrowDown from a button scrolled up behind a pinned header goes on from under the header, not to the header's menu (Zendesk).
pages/ring-under-pinned-header.html
start:css=#explore
key:ArrowDown*2
key:ArrowDown
expect-not:css=#menu
expect-not:css=#pricing
eval:(() => { if (scrollY < 600) throw new Error('the page went back up to ' + scrollY); return scrollY; })()
